OL,3,GNEWSAThree heritage 1950s railway
OL,4,Acarriages vandalised
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff at a heritage railway said they
OL,7,Fwere "disappointed" after three vintage
OL,8,Ftrain carriages awaiting restoration
OL,9,Fhad stones thrown at them and windows
OL,10,Fsmashed in.
OL,12,FVandals caused damage to the 1950s
OL,13,Fcarriages during the summer at Nene
OL,14,FValley Railway's site at Wansford
OL,15,FStation, near Peterborough.
OL,17,FCommercial manager Chris O'Regan
OL,18,Fdescribed the carriages as museum
OL,19,Fpieces, saying what happened was
OL,20,Fparticularly upsetting.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
